# shell: tracker
# PVL-051: the scrollbar is a CONTROL.  It was a picture: a pure function
# of the view redrawn every frame, which could be looked at and never used.
wait 6
expect-scroll 0
note a press on the track below the thumb pages the listing down
click 745 400
wait 4
expect-scroll 5
note and a press above it, in the track, comes back
click 745 150
wait 4
expect-scroll-at-most 1
note the stepper arrows are real now: the bottom one steps half a line
click 745 400
wait 4
expect-scroll 5
click 745 492
wait 2
click 745 492
wait 4
expect-scroll 7
note and the top one steps back the same two half-lines
click 745 98
wait 2
click 745 98
wait 4
expect-scroll 19
expect-scroll-at-most 19
quit
